source.command:
gh api graphql -F owner='{owner}' -F name='{repo}' -F number="{{item.number}}" -f query='
query($owner: String!, $name: String!, $number: Int!) {
  repository(owner: $owner, name: $name) {
    issue(number: $number) {
      number title
      subIssues(first: 100) {
        nodes {
          number title body state url
          labels(first: 30) { nodes { name } }
          blockedBy(first: 50) { nodes { number state } }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}' --jq '
"trace" as $require | ["draft"] as $skip | ["implemented"] as $done
| .data.repository.issue as $parent
| [ $parent.subIssues.nodes[]
    | (.labels.nodes | map(.name | ascii_downcase)) as $labels
    | select($require == null or any($labels[]; . == $require))
    | select(any($labels[]; IN($skip[])) | not)
    | { id: (.number | tostring), number, title, body: (.body // ""), url, state,
        labels: [.labels.nodes[].name],
        parent: { number: $parent.number, title: $parent.title },
        dependsOn: [ .blockedBy.nodes[] | { id: (.number | tostring), done: (.state == "CLOSED") } ],
        done: (.state == "CLOSED" or any($labels[]; IN($done[]))) } ]'

nodes.prompt:
You decide whether an unattended night build ("night-shift") continues after Feature #{{item.number}} ({{item.title}}) of Epic #{{item.parent.number}}. Nobody is awake: decide from the reports below.

The Traces of this Feature:
{{traces.summary}}

The validator verified and tuned the work. Its summary:

{{validate.summary}}

The tuning of the validator, when it did not pass the check, was removed ("pass" here means removed, empty means kept): {{drop_tune.outcome}}

The orchestrator read the work and steered the next workers. Its report:

{{steer.summary}}

Pick "halt" only when work on top of this code would be wrong: the code misses its spec in a way that the validator could not correct, or the spec contradicts itself or the code so that the owner must decide. In each other case pick "continue". In the notes: 1 to 3 sentences on why, then each step or decision for the owner.
